evidence-graph.iife.js is built from agent-action-capsule (ts/src/browser.ts) and
cll-ts by scripts/build-evidence-graph-iife.sh, at the commits that script prints.
It is vendored unmodified; evidence-graph.iife.js.sha256 records its digest.

